    "_doc": "<endpoint>.<Zigbee2MQTT property path>; endpoint 0 = device identity and availability (gateway: true/false). 'transition' applies to the next state/brightness command only. colorTempPhysicalMin/Max: ZCL 0x400B/0x400C as the lamp reports them (the radio adapter reads them).",
